  "bio": "Step into the vibrant and eclectic Rubber City Invitational, an illustrious tattoo studio nestled in the heart of Akron, where artistry and tradition converge. Our skilled artists masterfully ink within a diverse palette of styles—ranging from the bold lines of traditional to the intricate nuances of realism and the colorful, innovative flair of newschool. Join us for an unparalleled inking experience, and leave with a piece of Akron's finest artistry etched into your story.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Akron, Ohio, United States"
